{:tier :glm-5.2, :verse 13, :comments ["<b>And behold, a ram after [it was] caught in the thicket.</b> From this he understood that the ram was provided for him by the will of El, and that there was in it no suspicion of theft — since he saw that there had been no ram there beforehand, and immediately afterward he saw this ram caught in the thicket." "<b>Instead of his son.</b> In exchange for what was in his heart to sacrifice his son, after the manner of וְדֹבֵר אֱמֶת בִּלְבָבוֹ (Psalms 15:2)."], :book :genesis, :voice :sforno, :lang :en, :chapter 22, :notes {}, :source-witnesses [{"versionTitle" "Sefaria community Hebrew (PD)", "language" "he"}], :timestamp "2026-07-22T16:31:07.141354869Z", :translated-from :he, :model "glm-5.2"}